    "Based on the Apple Music player engine, it fully leverages the advantages of Apple’s software and hardware. At the same time, it addresses the compatibility issues of Apple Music, now supporting all music formats!" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "استنادًا إلى محرك مشغل Apple Music، فهو يستفيد بشكل كامل من مزايا برامج Apple وأجهزتها. وفي الوقت نفسه، يعالج مشاكل التوافق مع Apple Music، ويدعم الآن جميع تنسيقات الموسيقى!"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Basierend auf dem Apple Music Player-Kern nutzt es die Vorteile der Apple-Software und -Hardware in vollem Umfang. Gleichzeitig behebt es die Kompatibilitätsprobleme von Apple Music und unterstützt nun alle Musikformate!"
          }
        },
        "en-AU" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on the Apple Music player engine, it fully leverages the advantages of Apple’s software and hardware. At the same time, it addresses the compatibility issues of Apple Music, now supporting all music formats!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on the Apple Music player engine, it fully leverages the advantages of Apple’s software and hardware. At the same time, it addresses the compatibility issues of Apple Music, now supporting all music formats!"
          }
        },
        "en-IN" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on the Apple Music player engine, it fully leverages the advantages of Apple’s software and hardware. At the same time, it addresses the compatibility issues of Apple Music, now supporting all music formats!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Basado en el motor del reproductor de Apple Music, aprovecha al máximo las ventajas del software y hardware de Apple. También corrige los problemas de compatibilidad de Apple Music, ¡y ahora soporta todos los formatos de música!"
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Basado en el motor del reproductor de Apple Music, aprovecha al máximo las ventajas del software y hardware de Apple. También corrige los problemas de compatibilidad de Apple Music, ¡y ahora soporta todos los formatos de música!"
          }
        },
        "es-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Basado en el motor del reproductor de Apple Music, aprovecha al máximo las ventajas del software y hardware de Apple. También corrige los problemas de compatibilidad de Apple Music, ¡y ahora soporta todos los formatos de música!"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Basé sur le moteur de lecteur Apple Music, il tire pleinement parti des avantages du logiciel et du matériel Apple. Il corrige également les problèmes de compatibilité d'Apple Music, et prend désormais en charge tous les formats musicaux !"
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Basé sur le moteur de lecteur Apple Music, il tire pleinement parti des avantages du logiciel et du matériel Apple. Il corrige également les problèmes de compatibilité d'Apple Music, et prend désormais en charge tous les formats musicaux !"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Music प्लेयर इंजन पर आधारित, यह Apple के सॉफ़्टवेयर और हार्डवेयर के लाभों का पूरा लाभ उठाता है। साथ ही, यह Apple Music की संगतता समस्याओं को संबोधित करता है, अब सभी संगीत प्रारूपों का समर्थन करता है!"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berbasis pada mesin pemutar Apple Music, aplikasi ini sepenuhnya memanfaatkan keunggulan perangkat lunak dan perangkat keras Apple. Pada saat yang sama, aplikasi ini mengatasi masalah kompatibilitas Apple Music, kini mendukung semua format musik!"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Basato sul motore del lettore Apple Music, sfrutta appieno i vantaggi del software e dell'hardware di Apple. Allo stesso tempo, risolve i problemi di compatibilità di Apple Music, supportando ora tutti i formati musicali!"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Musicのプレーヤーエンジンをベースにしており、Appleのソフトウェアとハードウェアの利点を最大限に活かしています。同時にApple Musicの互換性問題を解決し、現在はすべての音楽フォーマットに対応しています！"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Music 플레이어 엔진을 기반으로 Apple의 소프트웨어와 하드웨어의 장점을 최대한 활용합니다. 동시에 Apple Music의 호환성 문제를 해결하여 이제 모든 음악 형식을 지원합니다!"
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berdasarkan enjin pemain Apple Music, ia memanfaatkan sepenuhnya kelebihan perisian dan perkakasan Apple. Pada masa yang sama, ia menangani isu keserasian Apple Music, kini menyokong semua format muzik!"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baseado no motor de reprodutor do Apple Music, aproveita ao máximo as vantagens do software e hardware da Apple. Também resolve os problemas de compatibilidade do Apple Music, agora suportando todos os formatos de música!"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baseado no motor de reprodutor do Apple Music, aproveita ao máximo as vantagens do software e hardware da Apple. Também resolve os problemas de compatibilidade do Apple Music, agora suportando todos os formatos de música!"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Основанный на движке плеера Apple Music, он в полной мере использует преимущества программного и аппаратного обеспечения Apple. Также решаются проблемы совместимости Apple Music, и теперь поддерживаются все музыкальные форматы!"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เครื่องเล่นเพลง Apple Music ใช้ประโยชน์จากข้อดีของซอฟต์แวร์และฮาร์ดแวร์ของ Apple ได้อย่างเต็มที่ ขณะเดียวกันก็แก้ไขปัญหาความเข้ากันได้ของ Apple Music โดยรองรับไฟล์เพลงทุกรูปแบบแล้ว!"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Music çalar motoruna dayanan bu uygulama, Apple’ın yazılım ve donanım avantajlarını tam olarak kullanır. Aynı zamanda Apple Music’in uyumluluk sorunlarını giderir ve artık tüm müzik formatlarını destekler!"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dựa trên động cơ trình phát của Apple Music, tận dụng tối đa các ưu điểm của phần mềm và phần cứng Apple. Đồng thời, khắc phục các vấn đề tương thích của Apple Music và hiện hỗ trợ tất cả các định dạng nhạc!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "基于Apple Music的播放器内核，充分发挥苹果软硬件的优势。同时弥补了Apple Music兼容性差的缺点，现已支持所有音乐格式！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "基於Apple Music的播放器內核，充分發揮Apple軟硬體的優勢。同時彌補了Apple Music兼容性差的缺點，現在已經支持所有音樂格式！"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "基於Apple Music嘅播放器內核，充分發揮Apple嘅軟硬件優勢。同時彌補咗Apple Music兼容性差嘅缺點，現時已支援所有音樂格式！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
