          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Song: [%@], Artist: [%@]. Please send me the album name, release date, genre, track number, and most importantly, the full LRC lyrics. This is strictly for personal local music organization and tag editing. Thank you!"
